Tamam. Aşağıda VTEP1 ve VTEP2 konfigürasyonunu birebir, satır satır yan yana yazıyorum.
(Sadece IP / peer farkı olan yerler farklı; geri kalanlar aynı mimari.)

🔷 1. Loopback ve VTEP Kaynağı
VTEP1                              | VTEP2
----------------------------------|----------------------------------
interface loopback 0               | interface loopback 0
 ip address 1.1.1.1/32             |  ip address 4.4.4.4/32
exit                               | exit

interface loopback 1               | interface loopback 1
 ip address 2.2.2.2/32             |  ip address 3.3.3.3/32
exit                               | exit

fabric anycast-gateway-mac         | fabric anycast-gateway-mac
 0011.2233.2016                    |  0011.2233.2016

vtep                               | vtep
 source loopback 0                 |  source loopback 0
 arp suppress enable               |  arp suppress enable
exit                               | exit

🔷 2. VRF-10 ve L2VNI (VLAN 10)
VTEP1                              | VTEP2
----------------------------------|----------------------------------
ip vrf vrf-10                      | ip vrf vrf-10
 rd 10:10                          |  rd 10:10
 route-target both 1000:1000       |  route-target both 1000:1000
exit                               | exit

interface overlayrouter 10          | interface overlayrouter 10
 ip vrf binding vrf-10              |  ip vrf binding vrf-10
 ip address 10.1.1.1/24             |  ip address 10.1.1.1/24
 anycast-gateway                   |  anycast-gateway
 route-in-vni                      |  route-in-vni
exit                               | exit

vxlan 10                           | vxlan 10
 extend-vlan 10                    |  extend-vlan 10
 router-interface overlayrouter 10 |  router-interface overlayrouter 10
 arp suppress enable               |  arp suppress enable
exit                               | exit

