🔷 6. BGP EVPN (EN KRİTİK KISIM)
VTEP1                              | VTEP2
----------------------------------|----------------------------------
router-protocol bgp 64512          | router-protocol bgp 64512
 bgp-instance router-id 2.2.2.2    |  bgp-instance router-id 3.3.3.3
 peer 3.3.3.3 remote-as 64512      |  peer 2.2.2.2 remote-as 64512
 peer 3.3.3.3 update-source lo1    |  peer 2.2.2.2 update-source lo1

 address-family-mode l2vpn evpn    |  address-family-mode l2vpn evpn
  peer 3.3.3.3 activate            |   peer 2.2.2.2 activate
 exit                              |  exit
exit                               | exit

